Description: Store the settings under the user settings directory
 The add-on read and wrote its preferences from the legacy home
 layout directly. Ask find_directory(B_USER_SETTINGS_DIRECTORY) for the
 location instead, the same way ReName already does, so the
 preferences window can save and the add-on can read its settings on
 V\OS. Each function that touches the file gets its own local BPath.
Author: VitruvianOS Packagers <packages@vitruvianos.org>
Forwarded: not-needed
Origin: upstream
